WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.144
Dingo: Pick the steps that deserve a star, then press Train.

2
00:00:03.544 --> 00:00:05.968
Wendy: Onions! More onions! I love onions!

3
00:00:06.368 --> 00:00:09.200
Kai: Um... I think we have too many onions...

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.192
Kai: I want a star... but how do I get one?

5
00:00:12.592 --> 00:00:15.256
Dingo: It took them a long time to find their first star.

6
00:00:15.656 --> 00:00:17.360
Wendy: We did it! Soup's up!

7
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.568
Dingo: See? They learn whatever you reward. Nice work!
